Oh, because it just keeps getting juicier by the minute.

00:13:33.139 --> 00:13:34.419
Are you sure about that?

00:13:36.339 --> 00:13:38.099
Why, are you going to do something to change my mind?

00:13:39.779 --> 00:13:41.259
Nice try, you're very cute.

00:13:41.419 --> 00:13:44.500
But I already gave you anonymity, and it's going to press tonight.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.860
But you're only just starting to scratch the surface,

00:13:47.059 --> 00:13:49.559
and I can give you so much more dirt.

00:13:51.319 --> 00:13:53.299
You're just trying to stall the article, aren't you?

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.659
I don't think you understand me, Chloe.

00:13:58.039 --> 00:14:01.159
I always get what I want.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:06.000
On looks, apparently, because your charm just ran out.

00:14:06.759 --> 00:14:07.379
Stop.

00:14:11.339 --> 00:14:12.199
Kiss me.

00:14:24.379 --> 00:14:26.439
This is me asking you nicely.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:31.820
You're going to drop that article whether you want to or not.

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:33.860
Please.

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:34.840
Please.

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:35.740
I will.

